sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant M as Memory
    participant L as LLM
    participant V as Plan Validator
    participant T as Trust Engine
    participant E as Tool Executor
    participant R as Runtime

    U->>F: Submit Request
    F->>A: POST /api/v1/agents/{id}/runs
    A->>O: Create AgentRun
    O->>M: Load Context & Memories
    M-->>O: Context Data
    O->>L: Generate Plan
    L-->>O: Execution Plan
    O->>V: Validate Plan
    V-->>O: Validated Plan
    O->>T: Request Authorization
    T->>T: Evaluate Policy
    alt DENY
        T-->>O: DENY
        O-->>F: Error Response
    else ASK
        T-->>O: ASK
        O-->>F: Approval Required
        F->>U: Show Approval UI
        U->>F: Approve/Deny
        F->>A: POST /api/v1/permission-requests/{id}/approve
        A->>O: Resume Run
    else ALLOW
        T-->>O: ALLOW
    end
    O->>E: Execute Authorized Tools
    E->>R: Run in Sandbox
    R-->>E: Results
    E-->>O: Tool Results
    O->>M: Update Memory
    O-->>F: Final Response
    F-->>U: Display Result
